Exception: the lettering on signs.
The glyph images crystalminer_{b52,c44,b34,b26,b17,r24,r20,r18,r16}_*
(and the lettering in the generated figures) are rendered from the DejaVu fonts, which are
derived from Bitstream Vera. See LICENSE.fonts for their licence, which must be kept with them.

Materials Project sample data
-----------------------------
The baked structure samples in data/mpcontribs/ and mods/crystalminer/exhibit_data.lua were
fetched from the Materials Project MPContribs API /structures/ endpoint. The licence of each
contribution's project must be confirmed and credited before release; this project does not
claim a licence for those contributions.
